{"title":"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/5/9e5952b0047153cfcff3216d8726b7d95760c545.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(x + b) = 3x + 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"150\" height=\"20\" /> for all values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/f/5df6a591474ffd81edd37d8d9f52f6f476caa531.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/d/bad5f816efa232175435bff46c8bb4d07f9acb9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 12 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 15 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 8 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 7 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"378\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/5/9e5952b0047153cfcff3216d8726b7d95760c545.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(x + b) = 3x + 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"150\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/f/c5fecf8d75f37705fdd6cb805442fbd1e7a3e7b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax + ab = 3x + 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"146\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>We can realize that since this is true for all values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/b/33b3c27171aba2140505212ce5b912115d1cdd69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />. We then have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/3/8b3dd4807071cc8b200aafcb1cce07d6321ee16b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x + 3b = 3x + 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"145\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/4/324a95ba11eea61d9e813377e15a25d3dd6d2daa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\frac{12}{3} = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"89\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/f/5df6a591474ffd81edd37d8d9f52f6f476caa531.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> is then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/b/86bda295509aa115f2a109c20e7fcf6d697e1e9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 + 4 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } 7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"123\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since this must be true for all values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, it must be true for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/3/2d348bde3e15456e71734dc2c56fc7425c95927f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/3/34310f2f36ed6d724838edb08788ee62acb33386.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />. Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/3/2d348bde3e15456e71734dc2c56fc7425c95927f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/1/9619d7757cd04a8c2a61316c5d20c44e2c46721b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(0 + b) = 3 \\times 0 + 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"170\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/a/74a2c3b6d08936f1ea5a17dfd597817c221dccff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>Next, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/3/34310f2f36ed6d724838edb08788ee62acb33386.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/1/951851674455fb534552f190ff58bb9109fbc84e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(1 + b) = 3 \\times 1 + 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"170\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/a/36a784da9614a8ef9af2c13f3642f2b3c4ee889c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + ab = 3 + 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"125\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/a/74a2c3b6d08936f1ea5a17dfd597817c221dccff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" />, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/b/33b3c27171aba2140505212ce5b912115d1cdd69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />. Plugging this into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/a/74a2c3b6d08936f1ea5a17dfd597817c221dccff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/d/a4d3ca81fe9a17dd476fc4b7e71e43cc3702fa72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3b = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/4/324a95ba11eea61d9e813377e15a25d3dd6d2daa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\frac{12}{3} = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"89\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/f/5df6a591474ffd81edd37d8d9f52f6f476caa531.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> is then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/b/86bda295509aa115f2a109c20e7fcf6d697e1e9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 + 4 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } 7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"123\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley\">2013 CEMC Cayley</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Problems\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Cayley_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CEMC Cayley Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td wid